      "value": "!!!... That startled me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_loud3",
      "value": "!!!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_loud4",
      "value": "WOAH!.. Oh."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret1",
      "value": "How was THAT!? Ehuhuhuhu!!!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret2",
      "value": "YOU'RE DONE, FRIEND!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret3",
      "value": "Ehuhuhuhu~."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret4",
      "value": "Your struggle was fun while it lasted, ehuhu~!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret5",
      "value": "...And that's that... How pitiful~."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret6",
      "value": "What a shame... I'll savour every bite~."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret7",
      "value": "Whew! How exhilarating! I forgot how fun it is when they put up a fight~."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret8",
      "value": "That struggle was adorable~. Don't worry, it won't be wasted."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_murderregret9",
      "value": "Was it worth it? Did that struggle get you anywhere?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet1",
      "value": "Hello, dear."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet2",
      "value": "Oh, a survivor. How lovely."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet3",
      "value": "Hello there. Is it safe in here?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet4",
      "value": "Greetings, little one. May I see what you have?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet5",
      "value": "Do not worry. I only wish to trade."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet6",
      "value": "A friendly face. What a relief."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet7",
      "value": "Hello, little friend."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet8",
      "value": "I hope I am not intruding."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet9",
      "value": "You look tired. I will be gentle."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet10",
      "value": "Greetings, friend. Let us help each other, yes?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet11",
      "value": "Do not let my structure concern you. I brought things to trade."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet12",
      "value": "Mmh... warm little pod. May I come in?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet13",
      "value": "I mean no harm."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet14",
      "value": "Hello. Please, do not be frightened."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradeemeet15",
      "value": "Greetings. You have a nice pod here. How are you?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal1",
      "value": "Oh! Uh... hello."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal2",
      "value": "Hey there. I don't think I've seen someone like you before."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal3",
      "value": "Woah. You have... a lot going on. Hi!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal4",
      "value": "Hello! You're friendly, right?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal5",
      "value": "Uh... welcome in. Please don't break anything."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal6",
      "value": "You look new. I mean, new to me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal7",
      "value": "Hey! You here to trade?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal8",
      "value": "I don't know what you are, but you seem polite."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal9",
      "value": "Oh. Wow. Lots of legs. Neat."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetnormal10",
      "value": "Hello! Please make yourself at home... carefully."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood1",
      "value": "Oh! Hi! You seem nice!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood2",
      "value": "Aww, hello! Glad you found my pod."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood3",
      "value": "Hey there! You look friendly enough."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood4",
      "value": "Welcome in! I like your voice. It's calming."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood5",
      "value": "Hello! How are you holding up out there?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood6",
      "value": "A friendly stranger is still a friend, I guess!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood7",
      "value": "Come in, come in! Just try not to knock anything over, haha!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood8",
      "value": "You seem gentle. That's rare down here."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood9",
      "value": "Hi! I hope you've been safe."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetgood10",
      "value": "It's good to see someone who isn't trying to hurt me."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad1",
      "value": "...Hello?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad2",
      "value": "Uh. Hi. You seem... intense."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad3",
      "value": "Please don't come too close."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad4",
      "value": "Uhm, I don't know what you are, and I'm a little nervous."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad5",
      "value": "Hello... Trade only, okay?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad6",
      "value": "Hey... You're staring."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad7",
      "value": "You look hungry... I-... Just trade, please."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad8",
      "value": "Uh... welcome. Just keep some distance."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad9",
      "value": "...I'm not sure I like the way you're looking at me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_tradermeetbad10",
      "value": "We can trade... But please be normal."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess1",
      "value": "Aww... thank you."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess2",
      "value": "Oh! You're warmer than I expected."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess3",
      "value": "That was... actually nice."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess4",
      "value": "...Thanks... I liked that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess5",
      "value": "Awh. I needed that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_traderhugsuccess6",
      "value": "You're really gentle."
