    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hungryresponse3",
      "value": "Hungry, are you? I've got plenty on me!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hungryresponse4",
      "value": "Check my stock, maybe I have something edible!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hungryresponse5",
      "value": "Hungry? I can help. If you have something to trade, of course."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_thirstyresponse1",
      "value": "I might have a drink somewhere."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_thirstyresponse2",
      "value": "You should find water soon."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_thirstyresponse3",
      "value": "Don't drink the weird stuff outside unless you have to."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_thirstyresponse4",
      "value": "Check my stock for water."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_thirstyresponse5",
      "value": "Thirst gets bad fast down here."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_sadresponse1",
      "value": "Hey... it's okay."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_sadresponse2",
      "value": "You're still alive. That's something."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_sadresponse3",
      "value": "You can rest here a while."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_sadresponse4",
      "value": "This place gets to everyone."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_sadresponse5",
      "value": "I'm sorry. I wish I could do more."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_depressedresponse1",
      "value": "...Please don't look at me like that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_depressedresponse2",
      "value": "...Hey. Stay with me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_depressedresponse3",
      "value": "...You need rest, or food, or... something."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_depressedresponse4",
      "value": "...Please don't do anything bad in here."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_depressedresponse5",
      "value": "...You're scaring me a little."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_selfharmresponse1",
      "value": "W-what the fuck!? That was a whole limb! Y-you just ate your own fucking limb!!"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_braindamagedresponse1",
      "value": "You don't sound right."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_braindamagedresponse2",
      "value": "What are you saying?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_braindamagedresponse3",
      "value": "Your words are all wrong."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_braindamagedresponse4",
      "value": "Something's wrong with your head."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_braindamagedresponse5",
      "value": "I don't understand you."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hotresponse1",
      "value": "You should cool down. Hit the heating button."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hotresponse2",
      "value": "Try the shower, maybe?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hotresponse3",
      "value": "Don't overheat in here."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hotresponse4",
      "value": "If you're hot, switch the heat down in the pod."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_hotresponse5",
      "value": "Oh, you can tweak the temperature if you'd like."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_coldresponse1",
      "value": "The heater should still work."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_coldresponse2",
      "value": "Warm up before you leave."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_coldresponse3",
      "value": "You're shivering. I've got a heater you're welcome to use."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_coldresponse4",
      "value": "Cold out there? Turn on the pod heater."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_coldresponse5",
      "value": "Stay near the heater if you need."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_bleedingresponse1",
      "value": "O-oh, uhm. I might have bandages!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_bleedingresponse2",
      "value": "You're bleeding? Check my supplies."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_bleedingresponse3",
      "value": "That needs pressure."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_painresponse1",
      "value": "Ooo, that looks like it hurts... Sorry, friend."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_painresponse2",
      "value": "Ow. Uhm. I might have something to help... In exchange for something of yours."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_dirtyresponse1",
      "value": "You can always use my life pod's shower."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_dirtyresponse2",
      "value": "Please don't get mud everywhere. Just use the shower, if you have to."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_encumberedresponse1",
      "value": "Maybe trade some of that away? I'd be happy to swap items!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_encumberedresponse2",
      "value": "That load can't be comfortable for you. Perhaps we could come to an agreement?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_dyingresponse1",
      "value": "Fuck... U-uh shit... What do I do..?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_dyingresponse2",
      "value": "S-stay with me!.. I uh... Fuck... Fuck- what do I do?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal1",
      "value": "Good day. You are... not a species I recognise."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal2",
      "value": "Hello. I do not believe we have met before."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal3",
      "value": "Interesting morphology. You are here to trade, yes?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal4",
      "value": "Welcome. Please avoid touching anything fragile."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal5",
      "value": "I must admit, I have no idea what you are."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal6",
      "value": "Greetings. You appear polite enough."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal7",
      "value": "A new species? Fascinating. Concerning, but fascinating."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal8",
      "value": "Hello. You may browse my wares."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal9",
      "value": "Those extra limbs are biological, correct?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetnormal10",
      "value": "I will be direct: are you friendly?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood1",
      "value": "Welcome. Your manners are appreciated."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood2",
      "value": "Ah, hello. You seem unusually gentle."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood3",
      "value": "Good day. You have a calming presence, oddly enough."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood4",
      "value": "I am glad to meet someone civil."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood5",
      "value": "A strange sight, but not unpleasant. Welcome!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood6",
      "value": "Please, come in. I would like to observe you... Respectfully."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood7",
      "value": "You seem cooperative. That is... A relief."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetgood8",
      "value": "Greetings. How has your descent been?"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad1",
      "value": "...Hello. Please keep your distance."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad2",
      "value": "...You are staring. I dislike that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad3",
      "value": "...I am not comfortable with your posture."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad4",
      "value": "Greetings... Do not touch me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad5",
      "value": "...I cannot identify your species... And that worries me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad6",
      "value": "...Your appearance is somewhat concerning."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad7",
      "value": "...Please make your trade quickly."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad8",
      "value": "...I would prefer a clear boundary between us."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetbad9",
      "value": "...Hello. You look hungry..."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet1",
      "value": "Good morning."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet2",
      "value": "You have awoken."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet3",
      "value": "I hope your rest was useful."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet4",
      "value": "You slept in a very unusual posture."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet5",
      "value": "Your limbs twitched while you slept. Is that usual?.. Excuse my note-taking."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet6",
      "value": "Welcome back to consciousness."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet7",
      "value": "I was not certain whether waking you was safe."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet8",
      "value": "You are awake. Good."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet9",
      "value": "Did you rest well?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwakegreet10",
      "value": "Please collect yourself before touching anything."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem1",
      "value": "Thank you."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem2",
      "value": "Useful. I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem3",
      "value": "I will add this to my stock."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem4",
      "value": "A helpful contribution."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem5",
      "value": "Thank you for the trade material."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem6",
      "value": "I accept this."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem7",
      "value": "This may prove useful."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem8",
      "value": "Very well."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem9",
      "value": "I can make use of that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitem10",
      "value": "Appreciated."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitemrefuse1",
      "value": "No more, thank you. I have limited storage."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitemrefuse2",
      "value": "I cannot accept additional items."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitemrefuse3",
      "value": "Please stop handing me things."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitemrefuse4",
      "value": "That is enough for now."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradergiveitemrefuse5",
      "value": "My inventory is sufficiently full."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess1",
      "value": "Reasonable enough."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess2",
      "value": "...Your proposal is acceptable."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess3",
      "value": "...I can agree to that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess4",
      "value": "...Fine. I will adjust the price."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess5",
      "value": "...You make a fair argument."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess6",
      "value": "...I will permit this exchange."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess7",
      "value": "Very well..."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess8",
      "value": "...I accept."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess9",
      "value": "...That is within tolerance."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglesuccess10",
      "value": "An agreeable compromise..."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail1",
      "value": "No."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail2",
      "value": "That is not a convincing offer."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail3",
      "value": "I decline."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail4",
      "value": "Your proposal lacks value."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail5",
      "value": "Seriously?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail6",
      "value": "That is not how bargaining works."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail7",
      "value": "No, thank you."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail8",
      "value": "You are being charming, not persuasive."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail9",
      "value": "Affection is not currency."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhagglefail10",
      "value": "I am not that easily swayed."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy1",
      "value": "Here you are."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy2",
      "value": "Take it."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy3",
      "value": "No refunds, naturally."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy4",
      "value": "A successful exchange."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy5",
      "value": "Use it wisely."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy6",
      "value": "This is yours now."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy7",
      "value": "Thank you for your business."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy8",
      "value": "I hope it helps."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy9",
      "value": "Do not waste it."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuy10",
      "value": "Pleasure doing business."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail1",
      "value": "Not enough."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail2",
      "value": "I require more value."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail3",
      "value": "That trade is insufficient."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail4",
      "value": "I am not giving this away."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail5",
      "value": "Pay properly first."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail6",
      "value": "No."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail7",
      "value": "That is below my asking price."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfail8",
      "value": "I need something more useful."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfailmaxvalue1",
      "value": "Enough trading for today. You've bought out a lot already."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderbuyfailmaxvalue2",
      "value": "I don't wish to thoroughly swap our possessions. Let's call it a day."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderthreatensuccess1",
      "value": "*Sigh*... Take something and leave."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderthreatensuccess2",
      "value": "Fine. Take something and go. I hope nothing but torment awaits you in those caves."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderthreatensuccess3",
      "value": "I see, why of course! Please, help yourself to my wares... Then go kindly fuck off."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderthreatensuccess4",
      "value": "I shouldn't have trusted you."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning1",
      "value": "Leave."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning2",
      "value": "Exit my pod immediately."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning3",
      "value": "You are no longer welcome."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning4",
      "value": "Do not approach me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning5",
      "value": "I am warning you."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning6",
      "value": "Back away."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning7",
      "value": "This exchange is over."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning8",
      "value": "Do not test me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning9",
      "value": "Out."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderwarning10",
      "value": "I will defend myself."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat1",
      "value": "FUCK OFF!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat2",
      "value": "GET THE FUCK OUT!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat3",
      "value": "THAT'S ENOUGH!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat4",
      "value": "WHAT IS WRONG WITH YOU!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat5",
      "value": "GET OUT, GET OUT, GET OUT!"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradercombat6",
      "value": "I KNEW SOMETHING WAS WRONG!"
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess1",
      "value": "Ah... acceptable."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess2",
      "value": "How affectionate."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess3",
      "value": "That was surprisingly gentle."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess4",
      "value": "You are warmer than expected."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess5",
      "value": "I will allow it."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess6",
      "value": "Careful with the limbs, please."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess7",
      "value": "That was... pleasant."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess8",
      "value": "Thank you. I suppose."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugsuccess9",
      "value": "You give very, uh... Secure hugs."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail1",
      "value": "No."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail2",
      "value": "Do not touch me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail3",
      "value": "I do not consent to that."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail4",
      "value": "Absolutely not."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail5",
      "value": "Refrain."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail6",
      "value": "I am setting a boundary."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail7",
      "value": "I said no."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail8",
      "value": "Not now."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderhugfail9",
      "value": "I do not trust you enough."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderseegun1",
      "value": "Gun away. Now."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderseegun2",
      "value": "Do not point that at me."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_traderseegun3",
      "value": "Put the gun away immediately."
    },

    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetimpairedspeech1",
      "value": "Your speech is muffled."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetimpairedspeech2",
      "value": "I cannot understand you."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetimpairedspeech3",
      "value": "Please remove whatever is obstructing your mouth."
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetimpairedspeech4",
      "value": "Could you repeat that more clearly?"
    },
    {
      "key": "dialogue_velvet_chr1_tradermeetimpairedspeech5",
      "value": "Your articulation is impaired."
    },

    {
